Right.  Please excuse a tangential comment.  In previous posts there
has been some confusion as to when a prayer converts the altar and
when a prayer converts the player.  You would think that a player with
average wisdom would know the difference between praying to one god
and praying to another.  Ignorant characters might just pray to
whoever is listening, of course.  How about an option, available to
characters with sufficient wisdom, to choose which god they pray to.
For example, when standing at an altar of a foreign alignment:

#pray
Pray to <your god here>? [yn]n
Pray to <fill in the altar's god here>? [yn]n
You look like you were about to pray but thought better of it--More--
Nothing happens.

